{"id": "tanakh-wlc-1chr-19-6-indirect", "corpus_id": "tanakh", "work": "1Chr", "locator": "1Chr.19.6", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openscriptures/morphhb/3d15126fb1ef74867fc1434be1942e837932691f/wlc/1Chr.xml", "edition": "Open Scriptures Hebrew Bible / Westminster Leningrad Codex XML", "language": "he", "mention_type": "indirect", "parent_source_id": null, "quote": "וַיִּרְאוּ֙ בְּנֵ֣י עַמּ֔וֹן כִּ֥י הִֽתְבָּאֲשׁ֖וּ עִם דָּוִ֑יד וַיִּשְׁלַ֣ח חָ֠נוּן וּבְנֵ֨י עַמּ֜וֹן אֶ֣לֶף כִּכַּר כֶּ֗סֶף לִשְׂכֹּ֣ר לָ֠הֶם מִן אֲרַ֨ם נַהֲרַ֜יִם וּמִן אֲרַ֤ם מַעֲכָה֙ וּמִצּוֹבָ֔ה רֶ֖כֶב וּפָרָשִֽׁים", "quote_format": "XML w-token transcription, with slash morpheme separators removed and spaces inserted; both ketiv and qere retained where XML contains both.", "context": "Аммонитяне нанимают колесницы и конницу.", "checks": {"primary_read": true, "quote_verified": true, "context_checked": true, "attribution_verified": true, "commentaries_checked": false, "interpretation_prepared": true, "independent_reviewed": false}, "interpretation": "Аммонитяне нанимают колесницы и конницу.", "epistemic_type": "direct_text", "reviewers": ["TAN-004 original Hebrew and adjacent context review"], "task_id": "TAN-004", "limitations": ["Indirect horse association; no claim that chariot/riding lexeme explicitly names a horse. Poetic ambiguities stated in interpretation. Commentaries and independent review not performed."], "accessed_at": "2026-10-10T17:57:14.699718+00:00", "matched_tokens": [{"hebrew": "רֶ֖כֶב", "lemma": "7393", "morph": "HNcmsa", "word_id": "13wMd"}, {"hebrew": "וּפָרָשִֽׁים", "lemma": "c/6571 b", "morph": "HC/Ncmpa", "word_id": "13YwG"}], "categories": ["military/royal transport"], "role": "military or royal chariot/cavalry/transport", "context_quotes": [{"locator": "1Chr.19.5", "quote": "וַיֵּלְכוּ֩ וַיַּגִּ֨ידוּ לְדָוִ֤יד עַל הָֽאֲנָשִׁים֙ וַיִּשְׁלַ֣ח לִקְרָאתָ֔ם כִּי הָי֥וּ הָאֲנָשִׁ֖ים נִכְלָמִ֣ים מְאֹ֑ד וַיֹּ֤אמֶר הַמֶּ֨לֶךְ֙ שְׁב֣וּ בִֽירֵח֔וֹ עַ֛ד אֲשֶׁר יְצַמַּ֥ח