{"id": "commentary:Rashi:gen-49-17:seg2", "corpus_id": "traditional-commentaries", "work": "Rashi on Genesis", "locator": "49:17:2", "url": "https://www.sefaria.org/api/texts/Rashi_on_Genesis?context=0&pad=0", "edition": "Sefaria default Hebrew book response; available version metadata: Pentateuch with Rashi's commentary by M. Rosenbaum and A.M. Silbermann, 1929-1934 | Rashi Chumash, Metsudah Publications, 2009 | On Your Way | test", "language": "he", "mention_type": "direct", "parent_source_id": "tanakh-wlc-gen-49-17", "quote": "הנשך עקבי סוס. כָּךְ דַּרְכּוֹ שֶׁל נָחָשׁ, וְדִמָּהוּ לְנָחָשׁ הַנּוֹשֵׁךְ עִקְּבֵי סוּס, ויפל רכבו אחור – שֶׁלֹּא נָגַע בּוֹ. וְדֻגְמָתוֹ מָצִינוּ בְּשִׁמְשׁוֹן: וַיִּלְפֹּת שִׁמְשׁוֹן אֶת שְׁנֵי עַמּוּדֵי הַתָּוֶךְ וְגוֹמֵר (שופטים ט\"ז) – וְשֶׁעַל הַגַּג מֵתוּ; וְאֻנְקְלוֹס תִּרְגֵּם כְּחִוֵּי חוּרְמָן, שֵׁם מִין נָחָשׁ, שֶׁאֵין רְפוּאָה לִנְשִׁיכָתוֹ, וְהוּא צִפְעוֹנִי, וְקָרוּי חוּרְמָן עַל שֵׁם שֶׁעוֹשֶׂה הַכֹּל חֵרֶם; וּכְפִיתְנָא – כְּמוֹ פֶתֶן, יִכְמוֹן – יֶאֱרֹב:", "context": "Entire verse commentary cell read. Exact segment 2 after HTML removal; explicit index title Rashi on Genesis. Index URL https://www.sefaria.org/api/index/Rashi_on_Genesis", "checks": {"primary_read": true, "quote_verified": true, "context_checked": true, "attribution_verified": true, "commentaries_checked": false, "interpretation_prepared": true, "independent_reviewed": false}, "interpretation": "Snake dislodges horse rider without directly touching him; the image is applied to Samson bringing down those on the roof.", "epistemic_type": "traditional_commentary", "reviewers": ["COM-003 worker"], "task_id": "COM-003", "limitations": ["Default API Hebrew response may combine available digital versions; metadata list does not identify a collated print witness.", "No independent review."], "accessed_at": "2026-10-10", "period_status": "Historical composition/edition dating not independently established", "confidence": {"quotation": "verified_in_named_digital_wit