{"id": "commentary:Rashi:judg-5-22:seg1", "corpus_id": "traditional-commentaries", "work": "Rashi on Judges", "locator": "5:22:1", "url": "https://www.sefaria.org/api/texts/Rashi_on_Judges?context=0&pad=0", "edition": "Sefaria default Hebrew book response; available version metadata: Sefaria vocalized edition | On Your Way", "language": "he", "mention_type": "direct", "parent_source_id": "tanakh-wlc-judg-5-22", "quote": "הָלְמוּ עִקְּבֵי סוּס. נִשְׁתַּלְּפוּ טַלְפֵי סוּסֵיהֶם, שֶׁהָיָה חֹם הַכּוֹכָב מַרְתִּיחַ אֶת הַטִּיט וְהַצִּפּוֹרֶן נִשְׁמְטָה, כְּמוֹ שֶׁמּוֹלְגִין אֶת הָרַגְלַיִם בְּרוֹתְחִין וְהַטְּלָפִים נִשְׁמָטִים, מִתּוֹךְ שֶׁנִּשְׁתַּלְּפוּ נֶהֶלְמוּ הָרַגְלַיִם:", "context": "Entire verse commentary cell read. Exact segment 1 after HTML removal; explicit index title Rashi on Judges. Index URL https://www.sefaria.org/api/index/Rashi_on_Judges", "checks": {"primary_read": true, "quote_verified": true, "context_checked": true, "attribution_verified": true, "commentaries_checked": false, "interpretation_prepared": true, "independent_reviewed": true}, "interpretation": "Star heat boils the mud, causing hoof coverings to detach. Supernatural battle assistance affects ordinary horses; no transport between worlds is asserted.", "epistemic_type": "traditional_commentary", "reviewers": ["COM-003 worker", "/root/core_verify_finish (independent of COM-003 author)"], "task_id": "COM-003", "limitations": ["Default API Hebrew response may combine available digital versions; metadata list does not identify a collated print witness.", "No independent review."], "accessed_at": "2026-10-10", "period_status": "Historical composition/edition dating not independently established", "confidence": {"quotation": "verified_in_named_digital_witness", "interpretation": "working_contextual_reading"}, "verification_notes": ["Exact quote confirmed in complete two-segment verse comment. Star heat boils mud and hoof coverings detach; assistance acts on ordinary warhorses. No horse ascent