{"schema_version": 1, "id": "bavli-sanhedrin-21b-13-davidson", "corpus_id": "bavli", "work": "Sanhedrin", "locator": "21b:13", "url": "https://www.sefaria.org/Sanhedrin.21b.13", "access_url": "https://www.sefaria.org/api/texts/Sanhedrin.21b?context=0&commentary=0", "edition": "William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic", "language": "Hebrew/Aramaic", "mention_type": "direct", "parent_source_id": null, "quote": "רַב יְהוּדָה רָמֵי: כְּתִיב ״וַיְהִי לִשְׁלֹמֹה אַרְבָּעִים אֶלֶף אֻרְוֹת סוּסִים לְמֶרְכַּבְתּוֹ״, וּכְתִיב ״וַיְהִי לִשְׁלֹמֹה אַרְבַּעַת אֲלָפִים אֻרְווֹת סוּסִים״. הָא כֵּיצַד? אִם אַרְבָּעִים אֶלֶף אִיצְטַבְלָאוֹת הָיוּ, כׇּל אֶחָד וְאֶחָד הָיוּ בּוֹ אַרְבַּעַת אֲלָפִים אֻרְווֹת סוּסִים. וְאִם אַרְבַּעַת אֲלָפִים אִיצְטַבְלָאוֹת הָיוּ, כׇּל אֶחָד וְאֶחָד הָיוּ בּוֹ אַרְבָּעִים אֶלֶף אֻרְווֹת סוּסִים.", "context": "Read 21b:6–17. Rav Judah reconciles biblical forty-thousand/four-thousand stable counts by nested stable/horse-stall counts. Textual exegetical reconciliation, not independent archaeological confirmation.", "checks": {"primary_read": true, "quote_verified": true, "context_checked": true, "attribution_verified": true, "commentaries_checked": false, "interpretation_prepared": true, "independent_reviewed": false}, "interpretation": "Read 21b:6–17. Rav Judah reconciles biblical forty-thousand/four-thousand stable counts by nested stable/horse-stall counts. Textual exegetical reconciliation, not independent archaeological confirmation.", "epistemic_type": "primary_text", "reviewers": ["BAV-003-YER-004-worker"], "task_id": "BAV-003", "categories": ["aggadah", "solomon_stables_exegetical_reconciliation"], "role": "solomon_stables_exegetical_reconciliation", "limitations": ["Digital edition/API segmentation checked; no manuscript or traditional commentary collation.", "Not independently reviewed; adjacent miracles do not establish extraordinary horse status."], "accessed_at": "2026-10-10", "period_status": "Historical composition/edition dating not independently established", "confidence": {"quotation": "verified_in_named_digital_witness", "interpretation": "working_contextual_reading"}}
