{"schema_version": 1, "id": "yerushalmi-kilayim-8-3-8-guggenheimer", "corpus_id": "yerushalmi", "work": "Jerusalem Talmud Kilayim", "locator": "8:3:8", "url": "https://www.sefaria.org/Jerusalem_Talmud_Kilayim.8.3.8", "edition": "The Jerusalem Talmud, edition by Heinrich W. Guggenheimer. Berlin, De Gruyter, 1999-2015", "language": "Hebrew/Aramaic", "mention_type": "direct", "parent_source_id": null, "quote": "רִבִּי בָּא רַב יְהוּדָה בְשֵׁם רַב מוֹדִים חֲכָמִים לְרִבִּי יְהוּדָה בְּסוּס בֶּן סוּס בֶּן חֲמוֹר עִם חֲמוֹר בֶּן חֲמוֹר בֶּן סוּס. רִבִּי חַגַּיי רִבִּי זְעִירָא בְשֵׁם רִבִּי אִיסִּת בְּנֵי עִזִּים בְּנֵי רְחֵלִים אֲסוּרִין זֶה עִם זֶה. דְּלֹא כֵן מָה אֲנָן אָמְרִין עֵז בֶּן עֵז בֶּן רָחֵל עִם רָחֵל בֶּן רָחֵל בֶּן עֵז.", "context": "Complete segment read within reviewed horse/donkey hybrid Mishnah cluster: attributed concession on specified alternating horse–donkey ancestry compared with goat–sheep ancestry. Do not infer literal horse from every hybrid offspring designation.", "checks": {"primary_read": true, "quote_verified": true, "context_checked": true, "attribution_verified": true, "commentaries_checked": false, "interpretation_prepared": true, "independent_reviewed": false}, "interpretation": "Complete segment read within reviewed horse/donkey hybrid Mishnah cluster: attributed concession on specified alternating horse–donkey ancestry compared with goat–sheep ancestry. Do not infer literal horse from every hybrid offspring designation.", "epistemic_type": "primary_text", "reviewers": ["BAV-003-YER-004-worker"], "task_id": "YER-004", "categories": ["halakha", "hybrid_ancestry"], "role": "hybrid_ancestry", "accessed_at": "2026-10-10", "quote_format": "Previously downloaded YER-002 full original Hebrew segment read; copied exactly with edition pointing/brackets; no fresh manuscript collation.", "limitations": ["Reviewed saved primary digital segment, not freshly retrieved entire halakha.", "Context limited to complete segment unless additional segment explicitly named.", "Commentaries and manuscript variants not collated; independent review not performed."], "boundary_species": "mule/hybrid; explicit horse parent or comparison preserved separately", "access_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/sefaria-export/json/Talmud/Yerushalmi/Seder%20Zeraim/Jerusalem%20Talmud%20Kilayim/Hebrew/merged.json", "period_status": "Historical composition/edition dating not independently established", "confidence": {"quotation": "verified_in_named_digital_witness", "interpretation": "working_contextual_reading"}}
{"schema_version": 1, "id": "yerushalmi-nedarim-6-8-13-guggenheimer", "corpus_id": "yerushalmi", "work": "Jerusalem Talmud Nedarim", "locator": "6:8:13", "url": "https://www.sefaria.org/Jerusalem_Talmud_Nedarim.6.8.13", "edition": "The Jerusalem Talmud, edition by Heinrich W. Guggenheimer. Berlin, De Gruyter, 1999-2015", "language": "Hebrew/Aramaic", "mention_type": "direct", "parent_source_id": null, "quote": "יִרְמְיָה עִיבֵּר חוּצָה לָאָרֶץ. יְחֶזְקְאֵל עִיבֵּר חוּצָה לָאָרֶץ. בָּרוּךְ עִיבֵּר חוּצָה לָאָרֶץ. חֲנַנְיָה בֶּן אֲחִי רִבִּי יְהוֹשֻׁעַ עִיבֵּר בְּחוּצָה לָאָרֶץ. שָׁלַח לֵיהּ רִבִּי תְלַת אִיגְרָן גַּבֵּי רִבִּי יִצְחָק וְרִבִּי נָתָן. בְּחָדָא כָתַב. לִקְדּוּשַׁת חֲנַנְיָה. וּבְחָדָא כָתַב. גְּדָיִים שֶׁהִינַּחְתָּה נַעֲשׂוּ תַּיָישִׁים. וּבְחָדָא כָתַב. אִם אֵין אַתְּ מְקַבֵּל עָלֶיךָ צֵא לְמִדְבַּר הָאָטָד וּתְהֵא שׁוֹחֵט וּנְחוֹנְיוֹן זוֹרֵק. קַדְמִיתָא וְאִיקְרוֹן. תִּינְיָיתָא וְאִיקְרוֹן. תְּלִיתִיָיא בָעֵי מַבְסַרְתּוֹן. אָמְרִין לֵיהּ. לֵית אַתְּ יְכִיל דִּכְבָר אִיקְרָתִנּוֹן. קָם רִבִּי יִצְחָק וְקָרָא. כְּתִיב בָּאוֹרַיתָא אֵלָּה מוֹעֲדֵי חֲנַנְיָה בֶּן אֲחִי רִבִּי יְהוֹשֻׁעַ. אָמְרִין לֵיהּ. מוֹעֲדֵי יי. אָמַר לוֹן. גַּבָּן. קָם רִבִּי נָתָן וְאַשְׁלִם. כִּי מִבָּבֵל תֵּצֵא תוֹרָה וּדְבַר יי מִנְּהַר פְּקוֹד. אָמְרִין לֵיהּ. כִּי מִצִּיּוֹן תֵּצֵא תוֹרָה וּדְבַר יי מִרוּשָׁלַיִם. אָמַר לוֹן. גַבָּן. אָזַל וְקָבַל עֲלֵיהּ גַּבֵּי רִבִּי יְהוּדָה בֶּן בְּתֵירָה לִנְצִיבִין. אָמַר לֵיהּ. אֲחַרֵיהֶם אַחַרֵיהֶם. אָמַר לֵיהּ. לֵינָה יְדַע מַה שָׁבְקִית תַּמָּן. מָאן מוֹדַע לִי דְאִינּוּן חַכְמִין מְחַשְּׁבָה דִכְוָותִי. מִכֵּיוָן דּוּ אָמַר. לָא חַכְמִין דִּכְוָותִי. יִשְׁמְעוּן לֵיהּ. מִכֵּיוַן דְּאִינוּן חַכְמִין מְחַשְּׁבָה דִּכְוָותֵיהּ יִשְׁמַע לְהוֹן. קָם וְרָכַב סוּסְיָא. הֵן דְּמָטָא מָטָא. הֵן דְלָא מָטָא נוֹהֲגִין בְּקִילקוּל.", "context": "Complete segment read: dispute over intercalation outside Israel, letters and public correction, then horse ride to spread decision; places not reached remain in error. Ordinary rapid messenger mount; exact rider antecedent not independently settled.", "checks": {"primary_read": true, "quote_verified": true, "context_checked": true, "attribution_verified": true, "commentaries_checked": false, "interpretation_prepared": true, "independent_reviewed": false}, "interpretation": "Complete segment read: dispute over intercalation outside Israel, letters and public correction, then horse ride to spread decision; places not reached remain in error. Ordinary rapid messenger mount; exact rider antecedent not independently settled.", "epistemic_type": "primary_text", "reviewers": ["BAV-003-YER-004-worker"], "task_id": "YER-004", "categories": ["halakha_aggadah", "calendar_messenger_mount"], "role": "calendar_messenger_mount", "accessed_at": "2026-10-10", "quote_format": "Previously downloaded YER-002 full original Hebrew segment read; copied exactly with edition pointing/brackets; no fresh manuscript collation.", "limitations": ["Reviewed saved primary digital segment, not freshly retrieved entire halakha.", "Context limited to complete segment unless additional segment explicitly named.", "Commentaries and manuscript variants not collated; independent review not performed."], "access_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/sefaria-export/json/Talmud/Yerushalmi/Seder%20Nashim/Jerusalem%20Talmud%20Nedarim/Hebrew/merged.json", "period_status": "Historical composition/edition dating not independently established", "confidence": {"quotation": "verified_in_named_digital_witness", "interpretation": "working_contextual_reading"}}
