{"schema_version": 1, "id": "yerushalmi-shabbat-5-1-6-guggenheimer", "corpus_id": "yerushalmi", "work": "Jerusalem Talmud Shabbat", "locator": "5:1:6", "url": "https://www.sefaria.org/Jerusalem_Talmud_Shabbat.5.1.6", "access_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/sefaria-export/json/Talmud/Yerushalmi/Seder%20Moed/Jerusalem%20Talmud%20Shabbat/Hebrew/merged.json", "edition": "The Jerusalem Talmud, edition by Heinrich W. Guggenheimer. Berlin, De Gruyter, 1999-2015", "language": "Hebrew/Aramaic", "mention_type": "direct", "parent_source_id": null, "quote": "הַסּוּס בַּשֵׁיר. וְלֹא כֵן תַּנֵּי. כָּל תַּכְשִׁיטֵי אָדָם טְמֵאִין וְתַכְשִׁיטֵי בְהֵמָה טְהוֹרִין. תִּיפְתָּר בָּעֲשׂוּיִין לְהַנּוֹתָן. וְאֵינוֹ עוֹשֶׂה חֶרֶץ. אֶלָּא כְּרִבִּי שִׁמְעוֹן. דְּתַנֵּי. לֹא יְגָ[רֵ]ר אָדָם אֶת הַמִּיטָּה וְאֶת הַכִּסֵּא וְאֶת הַסַּפְסָל וְאֶת הַקַּתֵידְרָה מִפְּנֵי שֶׁהוּא עוֹשֶׂה חֶרֶץ. וְרִבִּי שִׁמְעוֹן מַתִּיר. אָמַר רִבִּי חִינְנָא. כְּהָדָא דְתַנֵּי. דֶּלֶת גּוֹרֶרֶת מַחֲצֶלֶת גּוֹרֶרֶת קִינְקִילֹון גּוֹרֵר פּוֹתֵחַ וְנוֹעֵל בַּשַּׁבָּת. וְאֵין צָרִיךְ לוֹמַר בְּיוֹם טוֹב. וְתַנֵּי כֵן. מַחֲצֶלֶת שֶׁהִיא קְשׁוּרָה וּתְלוּיָה בֶעָמוּד פּוֹתֵחַ וְנוֹעֵל בַּשַּׁבָּת. וְאֵין צָרִיךְ לוֹמַר בְּיוֹם טוֹב.", "context": "Horse with shir prompts distinction between human and animal ornaments, beneficial equipment, and unintended furrow making on Sabbath.", "checks": {"primary_read": true, "quote_verified": true, "context_checked": true, "attribution_verified": true, "commentaries_checked": false, "interpretation_prepared": true, "independent_reviewed": false}, "interpretation": "Horse with shir prompts distinction between human and animal ornaments, beneficial equipment, and unintended furrow making on Sabbath.", "epistemic_type": "primary_text", "reviewers": ["talmud-finish-worker"], "task_id": "YER-005", "role": "sabbath_restraint_purity", "limitations": ["Complete saved YER-002 export-derived primary segment read; no fresh surrounding halakha retrieved.", "Merged export provenance not manuscript collation; no traditional commentaries or independent review."], "accessed_at": "2026-10-10", "period_status": "Historical composition/edition dating not independently established", "confidence": {"quotation": "verified_in_named_digital_witness", "interpretation": "working_contextual_reading"}}
